- Contribute your expertise to the architectural blueprint, ensuring it's optimized for efficiency, safety, low power, and testability;
- Deliver Impeccable Verification: Harness your prowess in System Verilog and UVM to implement top-notch automated verification. Explore formal proof, fault injection, and ATPG to guarantee quality and precision
- Document and Support: Share your knowledge by providing valuable documentation and support to our analog, verification, test, and quality team.

